Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But every day a dreamer\Nfights against reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems a struggle to be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were alone, I might surrender.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.88,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\blur0.6\c&H000000&\pos(1448,712)}Timing
