Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.98,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\bord0\blur0.6\fscx140\fscy140\4a&HFF&\pos(1492,776)}DraSleek
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weight's too heavy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I hear him say it,\Neven I can't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is the day, we'll\Nbury all our sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to raise the sails,\Nthey'll tell our tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through every tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.22,0:01:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is the day, we're\Naiming towards a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all our doubts are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause it's time to sail away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the new world.
