Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.10,0:01:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where our dreams will all come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bunch of fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to get\Nall sentimental like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can't cash it on his bounty!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.53,0:02:37.31,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,757)\fad(720,800)\blur1\bord2.3\fscx132\fscy132\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(675,720,\1a&H00&)\t(5980,6025,\1a&HFF&)}Dive, Dive, Dive!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:30.53,0:02:37.31,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,757)\fad(720,800)\blur1\bord0\fscx132\fscy132\c&HE5E5E5&\4a&HFF&}Dive, Dive, Dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't get out of our way,\Nwe'll arrest every last one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let the man play his\Nrock and roll, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.28,0:02:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's out of control,\NI'll tell you that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy came to arrest Soul King during\Nhis show when I was there to rioting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he made his escape, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You skinless traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that's not the big story here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soul King is actually a pirate\Nknown as the Humming Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the ride, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that was impeccable\Ntiming, I must say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can thank Chaka for\Nputting all this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends should be\Nwaiting for you at Grove 42.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so eager to see them\Nagain my heart is beating out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of my chest, kidding. Obviously,\Nmy chest is an empty void.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.22,0:03:33.76,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(193,524)\fad(420,400)\blur1\bord2.2\fscx110\fscy110\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(375,420,\1a&H00&)\t(6140,6185,\1a&HFF&)}Grove 41
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.22,0:03:33.76,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(193,524)\fad(420,400)\blur1\bord0\fscx110\fscy110\4a&HFF&}Grove 41
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So here's the skinny brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere but the Navy's\Nabout to close in and the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rest of the crew is headed\Nto grove 42 meet us there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up great you mean\Nyou weren't listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.40,0:03:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Navy, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us pirates, ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that clear enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you talking like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:04:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought I'd speak on\Nyour level for once. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After this, stupid cook, die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you know what all that\Nracket over there is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough yakking. Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out Sanji and Zoro found\None of the guys who insulted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, he's here with us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat a lesson into\Nhim with my own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because when you piss me\Noff, then things get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let this be a lesson\Nto all of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ever cross me, if\Nyou ever disrespect me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to end up\Njust like this chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget who's the boss of this crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that perfectly clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:05:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in that bounty somehow, and\Nit wasn't by playing News Nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this guy? Zoro, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend of yours or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got you surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody move an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, you and the rest\Nof your crew are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surrender immediately. The Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't bother running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We blocked off every exit in Grove 46.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys leave with us or you're\Ngoing to leave in a body bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My disguise is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did the Navy know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you think\Nthat this was about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, please tell\Nme we're not all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop flipping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we\Nrecruited all these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got pirates with hundred million\Nbounties here, but this is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then sit back and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caribou Europe use that marine as a shield\Nand make us a path out of this dump?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait what marine we sent\Na scout here earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that looks like he was\Ntaken captive damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although that would be\Nterribly convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it simply won't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because he told me he\Nhadn't called the Navy yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that makes him a filthy little liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caribou, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That crazy bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the captain here, damn it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, so much for that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You high and mighty type\Nseem to think it's all right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to lie to someone if\Nthey're a so-called bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I object to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they're not surrendering, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should have figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,George, show the pirates no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss is Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not going to lose to\Na bunch of chumps like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've got a plan, I'd hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to your captain, you\Nguys are pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy just said that I was his boss,\Nbut I've never even seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not have time to deal\Nwith your nonsense right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aim for the captain in charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lip service Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bounty's 88 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be idiots, but at\Nleast you're not cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him intimidate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a bounty of 92 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gashed Albion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.48,0:07:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Justice is on our side!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground is soaked with\Nthe blood of hypocrites.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:07:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its overwhelming stench makes me so sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A 210 million bounty, wet-haired\Ncaribou, too late to surrender now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it, no one said\Nhe had a Devil Fruit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we all slow down a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard that stress\Ncan lead to an early grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass-a-bistas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me they were going to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of want to beat\Nup those robot guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Hancock said to stay out\Nof trouble, so I guess I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those things that vaporize the mustache\Noff your stupid face, you nutbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy has been identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commence attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those things are aiming straight at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I even run or am I just dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping I'd get to\Nrumble with them someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lip service, Daddy,\Nidentified and subdued.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sustains no damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow the pacifistas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capture every pirate in your path!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodie's that cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bounty like that, and these guys\Ntook him down in only one shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang up, wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't waiting for nobody!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing took out Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can stop him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to beg, Captain, but your whole\Ncrew is about to get blown up over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no more left to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They keep calling for their captain! But.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My side is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lasers are gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your fat ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I mistaken or did they\Ncall you Captain Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't they call me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.83,0:10:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who you're talking to\Nright now, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get out of my way before I grab\Nyour intestines and pull them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.09,0:10:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd run if I were you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're face to face\Nwith the son of dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The revolutionary!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.27,0:10:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I'm the\Ngrandson of the hero! Garb!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh and my bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It clucks into 400 million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn on Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You human pile of garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy just took out Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.14,0:11:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They thought that they could join the\NStraw Hats and enter the New World!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this imposter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is triple-tongued D 'Amato Black, a\Npirate with a 26 million Barry Bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only worth 26 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at guys, the jig is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are we supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough this guy tricked us, but\Nnow we got the Navy called on us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess the real Straw\NHat is dead after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Straw Hat\Ndidn't get fat and gross?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy was just fat\Nand gross to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fat gross guy was\Npretending to be me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Sanji and Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:12:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They looked real, but I\Nguess they were fakes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is blowing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you aren't real Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you're just victims of this\Nfool, but you're still pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means a lot of\Nyou are coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And although I cannot imagine why, the\Nreal Straw Hat is here somewhere, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we entered the area, Pucci detected\Nhim on the stage with the impostors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire on Straw Hat, Pucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.52,0:12:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost blew up all my lunches!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did food ever do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... Huh? Oof! It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really him, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real Straw Hat was here\Nand we didn't even know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing has changed, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came here to capture Straw\NHat and that's what we're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had enough of you the\Nlast time we fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not supposed to start any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's no trouble, but\Nyou won't be setting sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike two years ago, I'm an\Nofficial Navy officer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I'm taking you in\Nif it's the last thing I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pucci, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
