Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Zora's not even fat! Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roronoa and Blackfoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should've known they were still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,R .I .P.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.83,0:15:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on summon attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who got him. Keep dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My kick broke his neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.14,0:15:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the real Straw\NHats! They're monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big ones were\Nnothing like this at all!
