Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and capture them already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta move Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We appreciate the help Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let nothing stop you\Nfrom reaching the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are making\Na beeline for Grove 42!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch them at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our King Baratie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just let the boy sail?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been out of the\Ngame, so take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an intense line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think that's intense, then\Nwhy don't you try crossing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.70,0:18:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really went all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our food stock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought in bulk because\NI'm sure everyone's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stomachs have gotten bigger\Nover these two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should keep us all happy for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They haven't had your\Ncooking in way too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, they get ahead of us somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're gonna have\Nto fight our way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm as worthless as a flea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up before — I'll be a tick. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.50,0:19:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.41,0:19:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to their morale?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.98,0:19:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing but a louse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sure looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I know it was you\Nguys causing that ruckus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.26,0:19:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fooling around with the Navy\Nwhen you should have been gone long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you a sight for sore eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.82,0:20:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were smart, you\Nwould have bailed by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't even be here if it\Nweren't for me, so don't start, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows where you would\Nhave wound up on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least you could do is be gracious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.62,0:20:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's an actual woman with real-life\Ngirly parts! Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is your damage, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.34,0:20:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys need to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.28,0:20:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a Navy ships nearby,\Nso you're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't get out of here\Nsoon, you'll never escape!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.69,0:20:42.46,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,799)\fad(800,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(755,800,\1a&H00&)\NRENDEZVOUS POINT OF THE STRAW HATS}{that is NOT solid -Ryan}{Evo: not sure why this was bracketed? Don't understand the comment.}{Z- this is a caption for the infobox, so it needs proofreading too. For instance, the # sign needs to be removed. Phos will typeset this against the infobox before releasing the ep}The Straw Hats' Rendezvous Point, Grove 42 Shore
Dialogue: 2,0:20:37.69,0:20:42.46,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,799)\fad(800,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx135\fscy135\fnKakumin Web\4a&HFF&\NRENDEZVOUS POINT OF THE STRAW HATS}{that is NOT solid -Ryan}{Evo: not sure why this was bracketed? Don't understand the comment.}{Z- this is a caption for the infobox, so it needs proofreading too. For instance, the # sign needs to be removed. Phos will typeset this against the infobox before releasing the ep}The Straw Hats' Rendezvous Point, Grove 42 Shore
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:20:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:20:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd abandon stardom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attaboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing could keep me from coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've missed you all so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that you two have only\Ngrown lovelier in our time apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all that in mind, there's\Nsomething I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already song time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.58,0:21:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Nami, may I look at your panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.50,0:21:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never let you look\Nat them two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I let you see them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just excited to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made my soul shake, and\Nit's still shaking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's about to leak out of my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you could have a\Nmuscle spasm without any muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it none of you have\Ngrown up after all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rejection aside, I was actually expecting\Nto be the last one here. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper is off looking\Nfor a missing companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about perfect timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GUYS!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you I would find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.50,0:22:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.30,0:22:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.94,0:22:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this day!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And everyone looks stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.22,0:22:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like it's been forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're the last...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.78,0:22:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:22:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone back in the\Nbirdie kingdom I say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.22,0:23:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.28,0:23:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has the bleeding stopped yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.80,0:23:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one, but two beautiful women\Nin front of me. Stay with me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.60,0:23:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.82,0:23:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting paler by the second!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.18,0:23:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look so cool, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.16,0:23:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you think so? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if you didn't, I could\Nchange my style at will, Mecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.64,0:23:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.72,0:23:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here while we\Ncan before the Navy's on top of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it looks like we're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see three Navy ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.66,0:23:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something fast,\Nwe're going to be dead in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:23:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.03,0:24:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sink that ship at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.80,0:24:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slave...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.71,0:24:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.46,0:24:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stopped in midair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We... Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.20,0:24:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Kuja Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.78,0:24:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me this, knaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of you had the audacity to\Nplace your disgusting ship in my path?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.86,0:24:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That flag, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.40,0:24:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.58,0:24:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the Kuja symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.08,0:24:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a strong crew of Amazonians\Nled by one of the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.72,0:24:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.82,0:24:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.73,0:24:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name is Boa Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say anyone who lays eyes\Non her will be enamored by
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.82,0:24:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her beauty and turned to stone\Nunless she grants you mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.62,0:25:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can see why beauty\Nstarts and ends with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.56,0:25:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had eyes, they'd be sparkling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.66,0:25:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's a real life goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.96,0:25:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she really that fine? Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.70,0:25:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.84,0:25:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where gotta find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.72,0:25:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see. I wanna. I wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.72,0:25:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's as hard as a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hancock said she wasn't coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.08,0:25:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We order you to move\Nyour ship out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.76,0:25:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're interfering with\Nofficial Navy business.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.48,0:25:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your ship that's in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.52,0:25:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I suppose it's you that's\Ninterfering with official Navy business.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.98,0:25:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, that's really an immature argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.52,0:25:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.48,0:25:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.02,0:25:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've bought you some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.22,0:25:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Circulus, I could die of ecstasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.34,0:25:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we have an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.76,0:25:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.88,0:25:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know that warlord or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.11,0:25:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made friends with her when that\Nbear guy sent me to Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.38,0:25:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the legendary\Nisland where only women live?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.06,0:26:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never believed it was a real place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.36,0:26:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been palling around\Nwith the pirate empress?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.44,0:26:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come clean now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.80,0:26:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't really training at all\Nthese past two years, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.72,0:26:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else would I have been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.10,0:26:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.08,0:26:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would have been a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.88,0:26:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.20,0:26:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.11,0:26:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So those are Luffy's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.20,0:26:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many strange\Ncreatures together before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.48,0:26:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.39,0:26:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like such a fun crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.98,0:26:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone in position to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.10,0:26:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, there's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.68,0:26:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.82,0:26:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something just occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.48,0:26:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never said you beat\Nthe Navy soldiers inland.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.00,0:26:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.91,0:26:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just flew past them,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.04,0:26:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we could hear them shouting\Nfrom behind us in the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.98,0:26:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what could be stopping\Nthem from coming after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.06,0:26:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Backup Unit\NPlatoon 3. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.84,0:27:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We read you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.04,0:27:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.95,0:27:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are unable to reach Grove 42.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.62,0:27:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.76,0:27:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, because there are giant bugs\Ncurrently halting our advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.52,0:27:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, giant what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.68,0:27:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things are monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.66,0:27:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone get in the\Nway of Usoppun going adventuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men don't shed tears when they part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.02,0:27:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Usoppun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.58,0:27:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares why they're coming after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.00,0:27:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The worse their lives are,\Nthe better ours will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.76,0:27:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, it's time to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.10,0:27:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, lead the way! You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.88,0:27:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.32,0:28:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Platoon 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.14,0:28:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid I have bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.76,0:28:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All our gunpowder has been\Nruined by a sudden rain shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.14,0:28:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.05,0:28:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.56,0:28:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forecast for Sabaody Archipelago\Ntoday is clear and sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.60,0:28:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunder would be excessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.76,0:28:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we don't want\Nto scare the civilians now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.74,0:28:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting those bubbles\Nto give us so much grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.12,0:28:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bubbles or not, you can't\Ncomplain about the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.64,0:28:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.55,0:28:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That breeze got us where we\Nwanted to be right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.66,0:28:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.72,0:28:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it's something for Nami,\Nshe gets nothing but the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.16,0:28:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll miss you on Weatheria, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.84,0:28:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But get out there and give it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.12,0:29:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.18,0:29:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is supposed to inflate?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.68,0:29:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.64,0:29:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now our boat's got a bubble roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.48,0:29:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.84,0:29:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ship that is properly\Ncoated has the ability
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.36,0:29:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to withstand almost any sort of pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.40,0:29:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it also has very little buoyancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.48,0:29:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The floating bag beneath the ship\Nis the only thing keeping us afloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.92,0:29:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By deflating it, the sunny will\Nbecome less buoyant and begin to sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.88,0:29:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty simple, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.58,0:29:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.24,0:29:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe not simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.58,0:29:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's spread the sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.72,0:29:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.63,0:29:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We use it to catch the water current,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.48,0:29:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,similar to how we would use\Nthe wind above sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.88,0:29:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping we'd just\Nsink down to fish man eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.48,0:29:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.39,0:29:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.31,0:29:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry unless we\Nwant to get in another fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.36,0:29:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Central Platoon 5 at Grove 42.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.80,0:29:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.58,0:29:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The troops from Platoon 2 have been found,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.54,0:29:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they've all succumbed\Nto a severe depression!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.86,0:30:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him to suck it up\Nand get back in the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.82,0:30:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.96,0:30:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have been born a waterfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.78,0:30:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we've been able to gather is that\NStraw Hat Luffy flew off on a giant bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.08,0:30:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's not even there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.46,0:30:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what are you guys shooting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.16,0:30:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are currently under\Nattack by unknown enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.82,0:30:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enforcement's got here quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.78,0:30:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just about to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.94,0:30:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.46,0:30:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat ship is now within range.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.74,0:30:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we may have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.54,0:30:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A large bird is heading straight for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.62,0:30:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.96,0:30:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, from behind, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.96,0:30:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.44,0:30:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like what you see, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.16,0:30:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotten a lot stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.36,0:30:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.94,0:30:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.74,0:31:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Platoon 5, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.22,0:31:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.42,0:31:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.54,0:31:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've hit interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.12,0:31:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't possibly\Nhave anticipated this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.28,0:31:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.19,0:31:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.76,0:31:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you ever think of turning\Nbeauties like us away, as if?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're all shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.60,0:31:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be ashamed of, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.84,0:31:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have a cup of tea and cookies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.94,0:31:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly, this is worse than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.04,0:31:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.30,0:31:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got such an adorable face.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.62,0:31:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.70,0:31:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.16,0:31:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Platoon 5, finish your report!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.26,0:31:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for you, Sanji. Make it count.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.64,0:31:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.55,0:31:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Sanji. Breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.06,0:31:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.88,0:32:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it felt like someone had\Ngotten a death grip on my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.78,0:32:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bag's deflated! Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.68,0:32:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.20,0:32:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.92,0:32:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ain't it, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.76,0:32:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.67,0:32:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just say the word, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.60,0:32:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
